   "id": "kinds-arrows",
   "title": "Types of Charms",
   "audiences": [
    "arrows"
   ],
   "intro": "Charms come in a few different kinds. Here is a quick look at each one, and the tickets that come with it.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "heading": "Major Targets – 200 tickets",
     "text": "Big life goals, like graduating, getting a job, or earning your driver’s license."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Minor Targets – 30 tickets",
     "text": "Smaller skills and experiences, from Life Skills to Stage & Competition, plus Connected Online and Attended Camp."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Bullseye Award – 200 tickets",
     "text": "A special award with words written just for you. Each person can earn one."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Attendance",
     "text": "Show up and earn charms. Bronze (2 events) is worth 10 tickets, Silver (4 events) 20, and Gold (12 events) 40. Attendance – 5 in a Row is worth 30."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Club Attendance",
     "text": "Every club has its own charm, and new clubs are added all the time."
    }
   ]
  },
